170
00:17:08.260 --> 00:17:11.890
Teate,
kui valus on seda pealt vaadata.

171
00:17:11.990 --> 00:17:14.009
See jube kindlasti meeldib.

172
00:17:14.109 --> 00:17:19.740
Martin, ükskõik mis sellest loost
ka ei saaks,

173
00:17:19.840 --> 00:17:25.280
